{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qdo7u1cb","slide":2,"name":"section-0-item-2","text":"3、用法用量：口服。一次60～120毫升，一日2～3次。","textPreview":"3、用法用量：口服。一次60～120毫升，一日2～3次。","textChars":28,"textLines":1,"bbox":[525,213,710,36]}
